      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would like my dead friend's name to never be taken up by someone so if I could. I'd downvote this post. Even at a lesser extreme, imagine coming back to the game after some time to find out someone else now has your name? Both are so horrible in my mind that I never want to see this enter the game. No disrespect but this is a bad idea.\nBy the way, it's not nice to call people you don't know \"randoms\" as if strangers have any less right to a name than \"influencers\" do. First come first served.",
