  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There have been many people who want names, but the names they want have already been taken by other users who are no longer active or show as much influence. I have friends who want to be influencers but their names are taken by randoms who either don't play anymore or have just been banned from playing and even still they still occupie the name even though they can't play anymore. If they were to make such a system where your name would be free reign over anyone it should set on the \"Knowability\" of the player for instance:\nVisitor:4-6 months\nNew User:6-8 Months\nUser:8-10 Months\nKnown User:10-12 Months\nTrusted User: 12-whatever\nBasic concept, but I bet complications will come so my main focus isn't on general people, but more so for influencers who want to make a name for themselves, but have to take strange names due to the lack of name changing policies and rules on Inactive accounts. With the suggestions made before they are open to interpretation and flexibility and are probably due to change since such changes would probably cause some out rage by either trolls or randoms (espeCiaLLy kNowN aND tRustEd uSerS)",
